@startuml
title アプリから見た SpiceDB とのやり取り — 読みと書きの基本形

actor "クライアント" as c
participant "アプリ" as app
database "アプリ DB\n(文書本体)" as db
participant "SpiceDB\n(スキーマ + relationship)" as sp

== 読み: GET /documents/design (bob) ==
c -> app : GET /documents/design\n(認証済み: user:bob)
app -> sp : CheckPermission\n resource: document:design\n permission: view\n subject: user:bob\n consistency: at_least_as_fresh(保存済み token)\n context: {current_time: ...}
sp --> app : HAS_PERMISSION
app -> db : 文書本体を SELECT
db --> app : title / body
app --> c : 200

== 書き: POST /documents/design/share (alice が carol に viewer) ==
c -> app : POST .../share\n{subject: user:carol, role: viewer}
app -> sp : CheckPermission\n (document:design, share, user:alice)
sp --> app : HAS_PERMISSION
app -> sp : WriteRelationships\n TOUCH document:design#viewer@user:carol
sp --> app : **ZedToken t1**
app -> db : 文書の行に t1 を保存
app --> c : 200

note over app, sp
  権限の判定はすべて SpiceDB 側。
  アプリが決めるのは「この操作はどの permission か」と
  「返ってきた ZedToken をどこに保存するか」だけ
end note
@enduml
